starter-configurable-service-extras
===================================

Out-of-tree helpers for `starter-configurable-service` (STCS):

* **processes/** — small CLI programs that print JSON on stdout, typically
  invoked via the `process-transport` plugin (e.g. `current-time`,
  `sun-position`).
* **plugins/** — reserved for future out-of-tree STCS `.so` plugins
  (install path: `$libdir/starter/configurable-service/plugins`).

1. Prerequisites
----------------

* Autotools (autoconf, automake, libtool)
* pkg-config
* GLib 2.44+
* makeinfo (Texinfo), for the manual

2. Build
--------

    $ ./autogen.sh
    $ ./configure
    $ make
    $ sudo make install

Binaries install to `$prefix/bin` (default `/usr/local/bin`):

* `current-time`
* `sun-position`

Texinfo manual:

    $ make -C doc info
    $ info ./doc/starter-configurable-service-extras.info
    $ make doc          # PDF, if TeX tooling is available

3. Quick test
-------------

    $ ./processes/current-time
    $ ./processes/sun-position --latitude 45.22 --longitude 12.0

4. STCS configuration
---------------------

House overlays typically reference:

    <command>/usr/local/bin/current-time</command>
    <command>/usr/local/bin/sun-position</command>

See the Texinfo manual for CLI and JSON details.

